Ltac wrun_tacBF B1_conc B2_conc FMVPC W_F F_F D_F RLV RV :=
  intros fx R M sp rr F fl Hsp Hrr HF Hfl G2 G8 G9 G10 G19 GSB (K0 & K1 & K2 & K3 & K4 & K5) FF0;
